sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Sender as Team leader or authorized external partner
    actor HQ as Authorized HQ approver
    participant API as Resource-request workflow
    participant DB as Requests and validation history
    participant TA as Configured TrackingAid connection
    Sender->>API: Submit personnel/equipment/supply request
    API->>API: Authenticate, validate scope and detect duplicate references
    API->>DB: Record Pending request and supplied items
    HQ->>API: Review identity, details, urgency and justification
    alt Incomplete, duplicate or rejected request
        HQ->>API: Return or cancel within allowed workflow
        API->>DB: Record decision and history
    else Valid request
        HQ->>API: Validate/approve and forward
        API->>DB: Save validation and handoff reference
        API->>TA: Deliver configured forwarding payload
        alt Partner available
            TA-->>API: Acknowledgment and later fulfillment state
            API-->>HQ: In Progress / Completed when confirmed
        else Partner unavailable
            API-->>HQ: Pending/retry state, do not imply completed fulfillment
        end
    end
    Note over API,TA: Live partner round trip remains an acceptance dependency
